title: Organisations of PPS
subtitle: Up to two investments in one action: press, TUR, Milicja or cooperatives.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
card-image: img/polish/polish_party_organizations.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && !!Q.polish_party_rules && PolishParty.organizationsAvailable(Q) !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card party.organizations (technical reference 13.5; card catalogue 5.1): one or two different
// organisations among the press, TUR, Milicja and cooperatives (since Z — 0.56 the unions have their own card,
// polish_party_union_investments), at most one package in each, one month and the sum of their R. Nothing is spent
// before the confirmation; a missing R blocks the whole package, never half of it.
PolishParty.organizationsView(Q);
Q.pl_org_pick1 = '';
Q.pl_org_pick2 = '';
!}

= Organisations of PPS

PPS has [+ pl_org_cash +] R. Choose the first investment; a second one for another organisation can follow. The card itself costs one month and waits two months before it comes back.

- @p1_press_distribution
- @p1_tur
- @p1_militia_recruit
- @p1_militia_militarize
- @p1_cooperative_workers
- @p1_cooperative_rural
- @easy_discard

@p1_press_distribution
title: Extend the distribution of the press
subtitle: 1 resource; the press reaches more readers (+10).
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.packageStatus(Q, 'press_distribution', 0).available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_org_press_distribution_why +]
on-arrival: {!
Q.pl_org_pick1 = 'press_distribution';
PolishParty.organizationsSecondView(Q, 'press_distribution');
!}
go-to: second

@p1_tur
title: [? if pl_tur_level = 0 : Found TUR ?][? if pl_tur_level > 0 : Start the next stage of TUR ?]
subtitle: [? if pl_tur_level = 0 : 2 resources; after two months TUR starts its work and gains cadres (+10). ?][? if pl_tur_level > 0 : 2 resources; after two months TUR rises one level and gains cadres (+10). ?]
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.packageStatus(Q, 'tur', 0).available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_org_tur_why +]
on-arrival: {!
Q.pl_org_pick1 = 'tur';
PolishParty.organizationsSecondView(Q, 'tur');
!}
go-to: second

