@second
new-page: true

= A second organisation

You may add one investment for another organisation, for the same month. Your choice is carried out at once.

- @p2_press_distribution
- @p2_tur
- @p2_militia_recruit
- @p2_militia_militarize
- @p2_cooperative_workers
- @p2_cooperative_rural
- @only_one
- @polish_party_organizations: Choose again from the beginning.

@p2_press_distribution
view-if: {! return Q.pl_org_first_org !== 'press' !}
title: Extend the distribution of the press
subtitle: 1 resource; the press reaches more readers (+10).
choose-if: pl_org2_press_distribution_ok = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_org2_press_distribution_why +]
on-arrival: {!
Q.pl_org_pick2 = 'press_distribution';
PolishParty.organizationsChoose(Q, [Q.pl_org_pick1, Q.pl_org_pick2]);
!}
go-to: result

@p2_tur
view-if: {! return Q.pl_org_first_org !== 'tur' !}
title: [? if pl_tur_level = 0 : Found TUR ?][? if pl_tur_level > 0 : Start the next stage of TUR ?]
subtitle: [? if pl_tur_level = 0 : 2 resources; after two months TUR starts its work and gains cadres (+10). ?][? if pl_tur_level > 0 : 2 resources; after two months TUR rises one level and gains cadres (+10). ?]
choose-if: pl_org2_tur_ok = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_org2_tur_why +]
on-arrival: {!
Q.pl_org_pick2 = 'tur';
PolishParty.organizationsChoose(Q, [Q.pl_org_pick1, Q.pl_org_pick2]);
!}
go-to: result

